/v1/","context":{"app_id":3475680,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3475680-1844115010491812","game_id":"steam-3475680","kind":"announcement","title":"The FREE DEMO is out!!! Grab a friend :D","summary":"Shared RC — FREE DEMO IS OUT!You drive left. They drive right. Straight? Only if you're both on the same page.The Shared RC demo is now FREE to play! 🎉Grab a friend, jump into the same RC car, and try to survive a bunch of physics-based courses where every mistake is a team effort.Whether you're here to work together, sabotage your friend, or discover exactly how long your friendship can survive controlling one tiny car — we hope you have fun!🎮 PLAY THE FREE DEMOYour feedback means a lot to our ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T12:01:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491812","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3475680-1843481262694850","game_id":"steam-3475680","kind":"announcement","title":"JOIN OUR COMMUNITY DISCORD!","summary":"Hey everyone!We’ve been working on Shared RC, and we’re getting closer to letting more people get their hands on it.If you haven’t seen the game yet: you and a friend control the same RC car. One person controls the left side, the other controls the right.Sounds simple.It is not.You’ll be jumping gaps, climbing ridiculous obstacles, solving puzzles, building giant mechs, and occasionally discovering that your friend has absolutely no idea what they’re doing.And somehow… you’ll blame each other.🛠","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T10:51:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd